<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 111,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 111,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Wednesday were 111,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $1.00-$1.50 per cwt lower than midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    56.50 -57.50	   57.50 -59.00</p>
<p>few						   56.00  58.00</p>
<p>Sows:  mostly steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-500 lbs.  44.00 -47.00	   46.00 -48.00</p>
<p>500 lbs-up	     46.00 -50.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
